        ["Your kit:"]="Tu kit:",
        ["Your line is in the chat box. Change it as you like and press Enter to send it."]="Tu l\195\173nea est\195\161 en el cuadro de chat. C\195\161mbiala como quieras y pulsa Intro para enviarla.",
