        ["/bf check - readiness check: asks party members with the addon for quests, key, gear wear, bag space and kit; /bf check answers off stops your answers"]="/bf check - v\195\169rification de pr\195\169paration\194\160: demande aux membres du groupe qui ont l'addon leurs qu\195\170tes, cl\195\169, usure, place dans les sacs et kit\194\160; /bf check answers off arr\195\170te tes r\195\169ponses",
        ["/bf comfort - switch the rested, weapon skill, flight time and durability lines on or off"]="/bf comfort - active ou d\195\169sactive les lignes de repos, de comp\195\169tence d'arme, de dur\195\169e de vol et de durabilit\195\169",
