        ["/bf durability - how worn your gear is, most worn first"]="/bf durability - l'usure de ton \195\169quipement, le plus us\195\169 d'abord",
        ["/bf enemy - enemy players you saw recently; /bf enemy off silences the alerts, /bf enemy sound on adds a sound"]="/bf enemy - les joueurs ennemis vus r\195\169cemment\194\160; /bf enemy off coupe les alertes, /bf enemy sound on ajoute un son",
